{
  "name": "Northlight",
  "category": "Landing pages",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "An architecture studio's portfolio site where project titles light up letter by letter as you scroll",
  "about": "A seven-view website for a small architecture and interiors studio in bone white, graphite and one terracotta accent. Project names light up letter by letter as they scroll into view, a photo preview follows the cursor along the project index, and each case study has drawn plans, sections and site plans, a before and after slider, a gallery and published carbon figures. The studio, process, journal and an enquiry form with a live fee estimate all work.",
  "how": [
    "Open a page from the top bar: Work, Studio, Process, Journal or Contact; on a phone use the menu button",
    "Filter the work by type or status, search by place or material, sort it, or switch the grid to the index and hover a row",
    "Open a case study, switch between plan, section and site drawings and hover a room to see its size",
    "Drag the before and after line, or focus it and use the arrow keys; click a gallery photo to enlarge it",
    "Save projects with the heart, then open the shortlist from the header and send them to the enquiry form",
    "Fill in the enquiry form, move the budget slider to see the fee estimate, and delete saved enquiries below it",
    "Press Ctrl+K to search, and use Reset demo data in the footer to start again"
  ],
